# cp blackbox-http.yml.example blackbox-http.yml ve alan adını ortamınıza göre değiştirin (2xx beklenir).
- targets:
    - https://console.staging.yanimda.example/
    - https://auth.staging.yanimda.example/realms/consumers/.well-known/openid-configuration
    - https://auth.staging.yanimda.example/realms/operations/.well-known/openid-configuration
    - https://status.staging.yanimda.example/
  labels:
    env: staging
